include LICENSE
include README.md
include CHANGELOG.md

# The conformance suite is the artifact another implementation checks itself
# against, so it travels in the sdist even though it is not installed. The
# specification travels for the same reason, and more so: the suite says
# whether an implementation agrees, docs/ say what it is meant to agree with.
recursive-include tests *.py
recursive-include examples *.ypy
recursive-include docs *.md
